      "A black‑and‑white view of a large historic building with a tall central clock tower standing on an open square. The structure has a steep tiled roof with dormer windows, arched entranceways at the base of the tower, and a lantern and weather vane on top. Trees and a few people and animals are visible around the square, along with neighboring townhouses on the right."
